(5971754, 872550, 10785, '<td valign="top">What the heck... did the Greeks land on the moon or something??</td>', 'What the heck... did the Greeks land on the moon or something??', '2010-04-26 15:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5971797, 872653, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I really like how you kept the grass/reeds in the foreground. Nice and sharp, adds extra texture. Excellent shot.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I really like how you kept the grass/reeds in the foreground. Nice and sharp, adds extra texture. Excellent shot.', '2010-04-26 15:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5971803, 873691, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. You either shot late enough in the day or used an ND filter to get the nice swirl/blur of the waves on those slabs, and it really helps with the tones and smoothness. B&amp;W can bring out a lot of over-sharpening, especially with waves, and you''ve done a great job of keeping that in check. Well done.</td>', 'Very, very nice. You either shot late enough in the day or used an ND filter to get the nice swirl/blur of the waves on those slabs, and it really helps with the tones and smoothness. B&W can bring out a lot of over-sharpening, especially with waves, and you''ve done a great job of keeping that in check. Well done.', '2010-04-26 15:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5971813, 871102, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think that was the landscape bus... and you missed it!</td>', 'I think that was the landscape bus... and you missed it!', '2010-04-26 15:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5971819, 873411, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. How did you not get lens flare on this shot? The glass I use would have been a mess. It''s so clean and crisp, not to mention minimalist, which as I''m witnessing goes a long way to making a quality B&amp;W shot. Beautifully done.</td>', 'This is awesome. How did you not get lens flare on this shot? The glass I use would have been a mess. It''s so clean and crisp, not to mention minimalist, which as I''m witnessing goes a long way to making a quality B&W shot. Beautifully done.', '2010-04-26 15:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5971824, 874158, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF and lighting throughout. My eyes are taking a stroll back into your picture. Very well done.</td>', 'Excellent DOF and lighting throughout. My eyes are taking a stroll back into your picture. Very well done.', '2010-04-26 15:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5971832, 872339, 75585, '<td valign="top">Great little town with gorgeous view!</td>', 'Great little town with gorgeous view!', '2010-04-26 15:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5971834, 873714, 10785, '<td valign="top">Looks like a label for a bottle of whiskey! Would like to see an outtake in a sepia tone as well. Nice use of the rule of thirds to get the mill framed well while still adding the stream. With the use of slow shutter speed you managed to turn this into a more dynamic scene showing the movement of the stream. It kind of gets brighter into the background of the image while it is somewhat dark in the foreground... I''d like to see a more even exposure throughout the scene. Perhaps the wat to do that would be to frame it so that the sky is cut from the scene. Overall a very good landscape image.</td>', 'Looks like a label for a bottle of whiskey! Would like to see an outtake in a sepia tone as well. Nice use of the rule of thirds to get the mill framed well while still adding the stream. With the use of slow shutter speed you managed to turn this into a more dynamic scene showing the movement of the stream. It kind of gets brighter into the background of the image while it is somewhat dark in the foreground... I''d like to see a more even exposure throughout the scene. Perhaps the wat to do that would be to frame it so that the sky is cut from the scene. Overall a very good landscape image.', '2010-04-26 15:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5971836, 873292, 113419, '<td valign="top">WOW  This is a wonderful image!</td>', 'WOW  This is a wonderful image!', '2010-04-26 15:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
