(5972958, 873616, 43191, '<td valign="top">I just want to grab that swan and turn her around so she is swimming into the image rather than out of it. I like how the white swan is against the blackest part of the scene.</td>', 'I just want to grab that swan and turn her around so she is swimming into the image rather than out of it. I like how the white swan is against the blackest part of the scene.', '2010-04-26 22:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
