(5972980, 873178, 43191, '<td valign="top">very nice. nice solid rock face on the right that holds you in the image. As my eyes wander to the right and try to leave, that wall of rock and plant life pushes my gaze back into the image for another look. Well done.</td>', 'very nice. nice solid rock face on the right that holds you in the image. As my eyes wander to the right and try to leave, that wall of rock and plant life pushes my gaze back into the image for another look. Well done.', '2010-04-26 22:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5972981, 872541, 43191, '<td valign="top">There is a little too much going on here for my eye to focus of anything. I learnt something recently at camera club, green and red are tonaly very similar, therfore when you have red and green together and convert to black and white the tones all blend together with very little contrast. I''m sure this would be way more interesting in colour. Hope I was of some help and didn''t offend you :)</td>', 'There is a little too much going on here for my eye to focus of anything. I learnt something recently at camera club, green and red are tonaly very similar, therfore when you have red and green together and convert to black and white the tones all blend together with very little contrast. I''m sure this would be way more interesting in colour. Hope I was of some help and didn''t offend you :)', '2010-04-26 22:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
