(5973247, 873616, 64670, '<td valign="top">Lovely location. <br/> <br/>Because the sky is so flat, I''m wondering if it would have been better to crop most out?</td>', 'Lovely location.  Because the sky is so flat, I''m wondering if it would have been better to crop most out?', '2010-04-27 00:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973252, 874181, 64670, '<td valign="top">Is that the sun over the triangle?<br/> <br/>What a beautiful location.   I''m thinking even less of the sky - almost to the top of the umbrella would have been more dramatic.</td>', 'Is that the sun over the triangle? What a beautiful location.   I''m thinking even less of the sky - almost to the top of the umbrella would have been more dramatic.', '2010-04-27 00:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973255, 873642, 64670, '<td valign="top">Lovely location. I would have been tempted to trip the foreground more.  The peaks are so dramatic on their own.</td>', 'Lovely location. I would have been tempted to trip the foreground more.  The peaks are so dramatic on their own.', '2010-04-27 00:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973257, 874289, 64670, '<td valign="top">Oh SO YUM.<br/> <br/>Seems many are frightened of the Black in Black &amp; White - glad to see you didn''t avoid it - it''s lovely.</td>', 'Oh SO YUM. Seems many are frightened of the Black in Black & White - glad to see you didn''t avoid it - it''s lovely.', '2010-04-27 00:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973258, 872514, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great title.<br/> <br/>Lovely etherial location.</td>', 'Great title. Lovely etherial location.', '2010-04-27 00:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973261, 873078, 64670, '<td valign="top">Amazing peaks.  I think the black is a bit too strong, it clumps the trees on the right too much.</td>', 'Amazing peaks.  I think the black is a bit too strong, it clumps the trees on the right too much.', '2010-04-27 00:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973263, 872597, 64670, '<td valign="top">Stunning - incredibly stunning POV and styling.</td>', 'Stunning - incredibly stunning POV and styling.', '2010-04-27 00:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973267, 874184, 15511, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, nice balance of the tones without the over-darkening that seems prevalent in this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent composition, nice balance of the tones without the over-darkening that seems prevalent in this challenge.', '2010-04-27 00:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973269, 873765, 64670, '<td valign="top">A bit busy in the foreground.<br/> <br/>The shadows on the front cactus are distracting.</td>', 'A bit busy in the foreground. The shadows on the front cactus are distracting.', '2010-04-27 00:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973271, 873605, 64670, '<td valign="top">Oh how charming.  Beautiful choice of perspective.</td>', 'Oh how charming.  Beautiful choice of perspective.', '2010-04-27 00:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973273, 872599, 64670, '<td valign="top">Lovely location.  The reflections are yummy - they make the image for me.</td>', 'Lovely location.  The reflections are yummy - they make the image for me.', '2010-04-27 00:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973276, 873725, 64670, '<td valign="top">The image is very busy.<br/> <br/>I find the B&amp;W too flat, not enough whites for me.</td>', 'The image is very busy. I find the B&W too flat, not enough whites for me.', '2010-04-27 00:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973281, 873554, 64670, '<td valign="top">Beautiful location.  Overly sharpened, which is harsh on my eyes.<br/> <br/>Like the sway of the river.</td>', 'Beautiful location.  Overly sharpened, which is harsh on my eyes. Like the sway of the river.', '2010-04-27 00:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973287, 871817, 64670, '<td valign="top">Like the square crop.  The black is too much, not sure what''s going on?</td>', 'Like the square crop.  The black is too much, not sure what''s going on?', '2010-04-27 00:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973289, 872216, 64670, '<td valign="top">Like this choice.  Wish the sun was just off the horizon.  Hope it does well.</td>', 'Like this choice.  Wish the sun was just off the horizon.  Hope it does well.', '2010-04-27 00:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973291, 873628, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great choice - bet it gets slammed, but the title helps make sense of what you''re trying to convey.</td>', 'Great choice - bet it gets slammed, but the title helps make sense of what you''re trying to convey.', '2010-04-27 00:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973302, 872773, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness, you still have snow?  Lovely in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Oh my goodness, you still have snow?  Lovely in B&W.', '2010-04-27 00:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973305, 872089, 64670, '<td valign="top">The image seems confusing.  The sky seems very smooth and the trees and river too sharpened.   I''m guessing HDR or the like.  <br/> <br/>Think it may have been better without and with more traditional processing, it''s a lovely location.</td>', 'The image seems confusing.  The sky seems very smooth and the trees and river too sharpened.   I''m guessing HDR or the like.   Think it may have been better without and with more traditional processing, it''s a lovely location.', '2010-04-27 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973316, 872198, 64670, '<td valign="top">My children would love to slice off a bit of that - looks intriguing.   However the POV is too busy on the right.  I like the right.</td>', 'My children would love to slice off a bit of that - looks intriguing.   However the POV is too busy on the right.  I like the right.', '2010-04-27 01:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973318, 873806, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do like this lovely open space sonear the houses - a nice place to escape to!  The picture itself is a bit bland with mostly medium grays.  The sky didn''t offer you a lot to work with - sometimes in those cases it can be best to limit the amount of sky you include.  Overall, you might try a bit more sharpness to increase detail.</td>', 'I do like this lovely open space sonear the houses - a nice place to escape to!  The picture itself is a bit bland with mostly medium grays.  The sky didn''t offer you a lot to work with - sometimes in those cases it can be best to limit the amount of sky you include.  Overall, you might try a bit more sharpness to increase detail.', '2010-04-27 01:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973321, 874284, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice S curve!  Nice contrasts, too.</td>', 'Very nice S curve!  Nice contrasts, too.', '2010-04-27 01:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973322, 872673, 64670, '<td valign="top">Oh so STUNNING - I so admire great night shots - can''t do them myself.<br/> <br/>LOVE the strength of the blacks - wonderful.</td>', 'Oh so STUNNING - I so admire great night shots - can''t do them myself. LOVE the strength of the blacks - wonderful.', '2010-04-27 01:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973327, 873226, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective and use of wide angle.  This works on all counts and should do very well.</td>', 'Excellent perspective and use of wide angle.  This works on all counts and should do very well.', '2010-04-27 01:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973329, 874079, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great image.<br/> <br/>I love the differing things to look at.  FLowers, trees, hills, fence.<br/> <br/>Not too busy - which it could have been, but you''ve handled it SO WELL.<br/> <br/>Love it.</td>', 'Great image. I love the differing things to look at.  FLowers, trees, hills, fence. Not too busy - which it could have been, but you''ve handled it SO WELL. Love it.', '2010-04-27 01:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973332, 874205, 30982, '<td valign="top">Classic rural.  Nice choice for the challenge.</td>', 'Classic rural.  Nice choice for the challenge.', '2010-04-27 01:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973334, 873033, 64670, '<td valign="top">Amazing water motion.  I have to master that one day.<br/> <br/>A little bit too much in the foreground for me.</td>', 'Amazing water motion.  I have to master that one day. A little bit too much in the foreground for me.', '2010-04-27 01:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973342, 873715, 64670, '<td valign="top">Lovely location.  Can''t find a point of focus, my eyes are unrested.</td>', 'Lovely location.  Can''t find a point of focus, my eyes are unrested.', '2010-04-27 01:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973345, 874106, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great choice.  A little flat in colours.</td>', 'Great choice.  A little flat in colours.', '2010-04-27 01:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973346, 874062, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful vista and great shades of light grays and whites, but to my eye this is very strongly oversharpened.</td>', 'Wonderful vista and great shades of light grays and whites, but to my eye this is very strongly oversharpened.', '2010-04-27 01:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973347, 873725, 15511, '<td valign="top">There are very few significant highlights above level 230. I''d like to see the highlights be a bit lighter. This would add contrast, also.</td>', 'There are very few significant highlights above level 230. I''d like to see the highlights be a bit lighter. This would add contrast, also.', '2010-04-27 01:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973350, 873135, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great location.<br/> <br/>I think a lower POV would have been more dramatic.</td>', 'Great location. I think a lower POV would have been more dramatic.', '2010-04-27 01:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973353, 873773, 64670, '<td valign="top">WOW - what an amazing location.  Love the trees.</td>', 'WOW - what an amazing location.  Love the trees.', '2010-04-27 01:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973354, 873814, 64670, '<td valign="top">Oh this is FABULOUS.<br/> <br/>Can''t fault it.</td>', 'Oh this is FABULOUS. Can''t fault it.', '2010-04-27 01:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973358, 873030, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love that lone guardian tree.  Very nice composition!</td>', 'Love that lone guardian tree.  Very nice composition!', '2010-04-27 01:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973365, 872817, 30982, '<td valign="top">Clean, crisp, well composed, and very well suited to B&amp;W.</td>', 'Clean, crisp, well composed, and very well suited to B&W.', '2010-04-27 01:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973370, 872673, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oooh!  Like the angle!  Very nice change from all the previous entries.  Toronto again, yes?  Works in B&amp;W but really shines in color.</td>', 'Oooh!  Like the angle!  Very nice change from all the previous entries.  Toronto again, yes?  Works in B&W but really shines in color.', '2010-04-27 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973373, 874250, 15511, '<td valign="top">The ocean has very good tonal range, but it''s hard to imagine that the foreground could be so dark as to have lost what may have significant detail.</td>', 'The ocean has very good tonal range, but it''s hard to imagine that the foreground could be so dark as to have lost what may have significant detail.', '2010-04-27 01:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973383, 873068, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the portrait orientation!  You have a few dust bunnies you can heal/clone in basic; and were it advanced you could remove the branch at the top.  But very nice capture - good use of the light!</td>', 'Very nice use of the portrait orientation!  You have a few dust bunnies you can heal/clone in basic; and were it advanced you could remove the branch at the top.  But very nice capture - good use of the light!', '2010-04-27 01:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973385, 873079, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet into the sun shot - nice handling of the light and lovely morning!</td>', 'Sweet into the sun shot - nice handling of the light and lovely morning!', '2010-04-27 01:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973388, 874084, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very lovely!  Excellent use of portrait orientation and I like the toning.</td>', 'Very lovely!  Excellent use of portrait orientation and I like the toning.', '2010-04-27 01:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973392, 873340, 30982, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit of work, but it does have a lovely view!</td>', 'Needs a bit of work, but it does have a lovely view!', '2010-04-27 01:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973396, 873624, 15511, '<td valign="top">I know we''re looking into the sun, but some enhancement in the shadow could provide additional interesting details.</td>', 'I know we''re looking into the sun, but some enhancement in the shadow could provide additional interesting details.', '2010-04-27 01:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973408, 873767, 15511, '<td valign="top">Interesting that without visual references, I struggle to find an anchor to base the exploration of this photo. This is not a bad thing, I''ve never seen an image that made me think I''m getting dizzy just looking at it.</td>', 'Interesting that without visual references, I struggle to find an anchor to base the exploration of this photo. This is not a bad thing, I''ve never seen an image that made me think I''m getting dizzy just looking at it.', '2010-04-27 01:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973417, 872938, 15511, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and good detail enhancement, but the contrast seems too extreme.</td>', 'Interesting composition and good detail enhancement, but the contrast seems too extreme.', '2010-04-27 01:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973423, 873995, 15511, '<td valign="top">I''m sure there are interesting details in the lower half of your image. Some enhancement of this area would provide that without lessening the darkness in the sky too much.</td>', 'I''m sure there are interesting details in the lower half of your image. Some enhancement of this area would provide that without lessening the darkness in the sky too much.', '2010-04-27 01:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973436, 874223, 15511, '<td valign="top">Although your sky is dramatic, the farm lacks sufficient contrast detail, so doesn''t stand out as your subject. Image is tilted, also.</td>', 'Although your sky is dramatic, the farm lacks sufficient contrast detail, so doesn''t stand out as your subject. Image is tilted, also.', '2010-04-27 01:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973444, 873345, 15511, '<td valign="top">Your details are well captured. They could be further brought out with "local contrast enhancing" unsharp masking, and even an inverted S-curve could also make visibly pleasing changes. The significant highlights are not bright enough, so you''re not getting the advantage of the full range of tones.</td>', 'Your details are well captured. They could be further brought out with "local contrast enhancing" unsharp masking, and even an inverted S-curve could also make visibly pleasing changes. The significant highlights are not bright enough, so you''re not getting the advantage of the full range of tones.', '2010-04-27 01:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973446, 873842, 15511, '<td valign="top">Your image appears just a little too unnatural with this processing, particularly the grayed highlights in the clouds.</td>', 'Your image appears just a little too unnatural with this processing, particularly the grayed highlights in the clouds.', '2010-04-27 01:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973477, 872994, 117088, '<td valign="top">Stunning composition. Absolutely mesmerising....</td>', 'Stunning composition. Absolutely mesmerising....', '2010-04-27 02:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973508, 874083, 35545, '<td valign="top">Very tranquil.  Good title.</td>', 'Very tranquil.  Good title.', '2010-04-27 03:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973514, 872836, 35545, '<td valign="top">Super clouds.  I think I would crop out a lot of the foreground to concentrate on the sky.  Not sure that portrait orientation was the best choice for this.  Good tonal range.</td>', 'Super clouds.  I think I would crop out a lot of the foreground to concentrate on the sky.  Not sure that portrait orientation was the best choice for this.  Good tonal range.', '2010-04-27 03:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973520, 873903, 35545, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture in the mountain.  I''m not crazy about the shrubbery on the right or the heavy horizontal border.  It makes me feel as if I''m peering through a slit.</td>', 'Interesting texture in the mountain.  I''m not crazy about the shrubbery on the right or the heavy horizontal border.  It makes me feel as if I''m peering through a slit.', '2010-04-27 03:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973524, 873766, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot with lots of detail and good texture in the water.</td>', 'Nice clear shot with lots of detail and good texture in the water.', '2010-04-27 03:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973529, 874031, 35545, '<td valign="top">I feel as if this is more of an informal portrait than a landscape.  Could use more contrast.</td>', 'I feel as if this is more of an informal portrait than a landscape.  Could use more contrast.', '2010-04-27 03:32:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5973530, 874063, 35545, '<td valign="top">Could use more contrast.  Nice texture in the water.</td>', 'Could use more contrast.  Nice texture in the water.', '2010-04-27 03:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973533, 872186, 35545, '<td valign="top">Could use more contrast.  Good texture and reflections in the water.</td>', 'Could use more contrast.  Good texture and reflections in the water.', '2010-04-27 03:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973539, 873225, 35545, '<td valign="top">I''d try a closer crop -- the stuff in the lower right really doesn''t add much to the shot.  The city and river are a lot more interesting.  Nice reflection and texture in the water.</td>', 'I''d try a closer crop -- the stuff in the lower right really doesn''t add much to the shot.  The city and river are a lot more interesting.  Nice reflection and texture in the water.', '2010-04-27 03:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973542, 873231, 35545, '<td valign="top">Over processed.  Nice sky and clouds.</td>', 'Over processed.  Nice sky and clouds.', '2010-04-27 03:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973545, 874283, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice sky and leading line with the water.  Needs more contrast IMNSHO.</td>', 'Nice sky and leading line with the water.  Needs more contrast IMNSHO.', '2010-04-27 03:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973547, 872532, 35545, '<td valign="top">I like the backlighting.</td>', 'I like the backlighting.', '2010-04-27 03:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973551, 873294, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast IMNSHO.  Nice treatment of the water.</td>', 'Needs more contrast IMNSHO.  Nice treatment of the water.', '2010-04-27 03:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973553, 874184, 35545, '<td valign="top">Love the way the reflections and bridge form "circles".  Needs more contrast though.</td>', 'Love the way the reflections and bridge form "circles".  Needs more contrast though.', '2010-04-27 03:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973554, 872244, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast.  Nice pastoral scene.</td>', 'Needs more contrast.  Nice pastoral scene.', '2010-04-27 03:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973556, 874217, 35545, '<td valign="top">What is the purpose of the tilt?  I feel like I''m falling out of the frame.</td>', 'What is the purpose of the tilt?  I feel like I''m falling out of the frame.', '2010-04-27 03:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973557, 871851, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white shot with a better tonal range than most of the shots in the challenge.  However, I don''t really see this as a landscape.</td>', 'Nice black and white shot with a better tonal range than most of the shots in the challenge.  However, I don''t really see this as a landscape.', '2010-04-27 03:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973558, 874077, 35545, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the junk floating in the water.  Otherwise, great composition with reflections and a very interesting bridge.  Nice tonal range.</td>', 'Too bad about the junk floating in the water.  Otherwise, great composition with reflections and a very interesting bridge.  Nice tonal range.', '2010-04-27 03:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973559, 873182, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot with good detail and good tonal range.</td>', 'Nice clear shot with good detail and good tonal range.', '2010-04-27 03:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973561, 871102, 35545, '<td valign="top">Landscape?</td>', 'Landscape?', '2010-04-27 03:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973564, 874044, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonal water element in the creek.  I''ll admit to having a bias against landscapes shot in portrait format, and if it were me (which it isn''t), I''d lop off most of the top and have a more square format.</td>', 'Nice diagonal water element in the creek.  I''ll admit to having a bias against landscapes shot in portrait format, and if it were me (which it isn''t), I''d lop off most of the top and have a more square format.', '2010-04-27 03:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973565, 873817, 35545, '<td valign="top">Lensbaby?  Not sure why you put the sweet spot on the road.  It''s an interesting texture, but the barn looks a lot more interesting.</td>', 'Lensbaby?  Not sure why you put the sweet spot on the road.  It''s an interesting texture, but the barn looks a lot more interesting.', '2010-04-27 03:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973566, 873727, 35545, '<td valign="top">Amazing depth of field.  Nice tonal range.</td>', 'Amazing depth of field.  Nice tonal range.', '2010-04-27 03:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973568, 872066, 35545, '<td valign="top">Great texture and detail in the driftwood.</td>', 'Great texture and detail in the driftwood.', '2010-04-27 03:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973569, 873213, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs a lot more contrast.  I can hardly find the girl.</td>', 'Needs a lot more contrast.  I can hardly find the girl.', '2010-04-27 03:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973570, 872278, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful texture and tonal range.  I like the diagonal placement of the ripples of sand.</td>', 'Beautiful texture and tonal range.  I like the diagonal placement of the ripples of sand.', '2010-04-27 03:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973571, 874050, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot with lots of good detail.  Could use more contrast though.</td>', 'Nice clear shot with lots of good detail.  Could use more contrast though.', '2010-04-27 03:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973572, 873605, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good detail and contrast.  Nice tonal range.</td>', 'Good detail and contrast.  Nice tonal range.', '2010-04-27 03:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973574, 872866, 35545, '<td valign="top">The white sky at the top is a distraction for me.  I''d crop it out.  The whole shot could use more contrast.  Interesting leading line in the curved walkway.</td>', 'The white sky at the top is a distraction for me.  I''d crop it out.  The whole shot could use more contrast.  Interesting leading line in the curved walkway.', '2010-04-27 04:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973575, 873994, 35545, '<td valign="top">Great clouds and mountains -- reminds me of a Japanese painting.  IMNSHO that big, blank sky doesn''t add to the shot -- I''d crop a lot of it out and concentrate on the different tones in the mountains which ad a very interesting diagonal to the composition.</td>', 'Great clouds and mountains -- reminds me of a Japanese painting.  IMNSHO that big, blank sky doesn''t add to the shot -- I''d crop a lot of it out and concentrate on the different tones in the mountains which ad a very interesting diagonal to the composition.', '2010-04-27 04:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973577, 874244, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but I wish it had more contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but I wish it had more contrast.', '2010-04-27 04:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973578, 873887, 35545, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you added that horizontal border.  I''d rather see more of the great night shot.</td>', 'Not sure why you added that horizontal border.  I''d rather see more of the great night shot.', '2010-04-27 04:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973579, 872566, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice water shot at night.  I''d rather look at the picture than the horizontal border -- it takes up too much space.</td>', 'Nice water shot at night.  I''d rather look at the picture than the horizontal border -- it takes up too much space.', '2010-04-27 04:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973580, 874153, 35545, '<td valign="top">IMNSHO, this would be a much better shot if you cropped out a lot of that big, blank sky.  Also, a large part of the water is blown out.</td>', 'IMNSHO, this would be a much better shot if you cropped out a lot of that big, blank sky.  Also, a large part of the water is blown out.', '2010-04-27 04:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973581, 874082, 35545, '<td valign="top">Landscape or cute kid shot?</td>', 'Landscape or cute kid shot?', '2010-04-27 04:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973582, 871962, 35545, '<td valign="top">Landscape?</td>', 'Landscape?', '2010-04-27 04:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
