(5975231, 872936, 79602, '<td valign="top">I love the ray of light hitting the main tree.  I feel a crop from the right side, cutting out the small sliver of tree trunk and branch/weed, would make the composition stronger.  Because there is so much detail in the background, an f-stop allowing for a a more shallow depth of field might have helped isolate the main tree as well.  Good eye!</td>', 'I love the ray of light hitting the main tree.  I feel a crop from the right side, cutting out the small sliver of tree trunk and branch/weed, would make the composition stronger.  Because there is so much detail in the background, an f-stop allowing for a a more shallow depth of field might have helped isolate the main tree as well.  Good eye!', '2010-04-27 21:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5975232, 872046, 66635, '<td valign="top">Now there are a lot of wonderful images in this challenge, but this should take the blue!</td>', 'Now there are a lot of wonderful images in this challenge, but this should take the blue!', '2010-04-27 21:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
