(5975713, 874181, 63633, '<td valign="top">Wish I was there! I find it hard to determine a clear point of interest/focus in this shot though. My eye wanders all about tty to catch something.</td>', 'Wish I was there! I find it hard to determine a clear point of interest/focus in this shot though. My eye wanders all about tty to catch something.', '2010-04-28 00:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
