(5975773, 873393, 115307, '<td valign="top">This shot reminds me of Ansel Adams for some reason. You should consider that a high high compliment.<br/>I love the little people. 10 from me</td>', 'This shot reminds me of Ansel Adams for some reason. You should consider that a high high compliment.I love the little people. 10 from me', '2010-04-28 00:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
