(5980791, 873861, 5364, '<td valign="top">I tried looking at this without the letterbox borders and I found I liked it much better.</td>', 'I tried looking at this without the letterbox borders and I found I liked it much better.', '2010-04-30 09:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980800, 873616, 103142, '<td valign="top">There are many times that I like an animal pushing the limits of the frame, but with the swan, I think it ended up looking squished. <br/> <br/>In this photo the swan is by far the most interesting part. I love the set of his wings and the darker water with the reflection. Unfortunately, the rest pales in comparison and overwhelms the image. The sky is a large part of the photo, but doesn''t hold any interest. It ends up centering the tree, which I think would have been better off not centered. Sorry, it just doesn''t work, imo.</td>', 'There are many times that I like an animal pushing the limits of the frame, but with the swan, I think it ended up looking squished.  In this photo the swan is by far the most interesting part. I love the set of his wings and the darker water with the reflection. Unfortunately, the rest pales in comparison and overwhelms the image. The sky is a large part of the photo, but doesn''t hold any interest. It ends up centering the tree, which I think would have been better off not centered. Sorry, it just doesn''t work, imo.', '2010-04-30 09:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980803, 874050, 103142, '<td valign="top">My first thought on this photo was: interesting. Second thought: extremely busy. I would have loved to see a shot from the beach with just a few of the beach umbrellas in the foreground and the ship in the distance. Strangely enough, the light pole in the foreground is very distracting. Surprises me, because it''s not particularly glaring or anything, but it keeps drawing my eye.</td>', 'My first thought on this photo was: interesting. Second thought: extremely busy. I would have loved to see a shot from the beach with just a few of the beach umbrellas in the foreground and the ship in the distance. Strangely enough, the light pole in the foreground is very distracting. Surprises me, because it''s not particularly glaring or anything, but it keeps drawing my eye.', '2010-04-30 09:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980804, 873991, 103142, '<td valign="top">Well done. I find haze shots difficult to do, and I really like your mountains. The foreground seems very muddy. Did you try shadows and highlights to try to gain some detail?</td>', 'Well done. I find haze shots difficult to do, and I really like your mountains. The foreground seems very muddy. Did you try shadows and highlights to try to gain some detail?', '2010-04-30 09:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
