(5981088, 873824, 15511, '<td valign="top">I like these kinds of images - almost abstract - that have a range of tones displayed in an increasing order. Your title asks me to find the subject, though, as it is not the initial interest object. I can see banding in the sky, though it may be accentuated by my economonitor...</td>', 'I like these kinds of images - almost abstract - that have a range of tones displayed in an increasing order. Your title asks me to find the subject, though, as it is not the initial interest object. I can see banding in the sky, though it may be accentuated by my economonitor...', '2010-04-30 14:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981092, 874228, 15511, '<td valign="top">A pleasing photo, not atypical of those I enjoy here at DPC. Unless I''m mistaken, there''s no land in this image. If the tide is out, that''s a clean beach!</td>', 'A pleasing photo, not atypical of those I enjoy here at DPC. Unless I''m mistaken, there''s no land in this image. If the tide is out, that''s a clean beach!', '2010-04-30 14:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981093, 873715, 15511, '<td valign="top">I like this image. If there was a way to show more detail in the buildings on the left, I''d like it more.</td>', 'I like this image. If there was a way to show more detail in the buildings on the left, I''d like it more.', '2010-04-30 14:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981101, 873266, 15511, '<td valign="top">I can see that the furthest two rows of trees have a very slight blue or blue/green color cast to them, while the rest of the image is neutral. The effect works visually rather well in a B/W image to give increased contrast. An interesting technique worth investigation.</td>', 'I can see that the furthest two rows of trees have a very slight blue or blue/green color cast to them, while the rest of the image is neutral. The effect works visually rather well in a B/W image to give increased contrast. An interesting technique worth investigation.', '2010-04-30 14:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981104, 873702, 15511, '<td valign="top">The dark portions seem just a bit too dark, causing the impression that the waterfall was lit from within. Wouldn''t some lightening of the mid-tones look more realistic?</td>', 'The dark portions seem just a bit too dark, causing the impression that the waterfall was lit from within. Wouldn''t some lightening of the mid-tones look more realistic?', '2010-04-30 14:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981109, 872511, 15511, '<td valign="top">The level of details is remarkable. Although it is possible that the horizon is not level, in this image the tilt plays a significant part of viewing this well crafted image. The popularity of overly dark skies will hopefully pass.</td>', 'The level of details is remarkable. Although it is possible that the horizon is not level, in this image the tilt plays a significant part of viewing this well crafted image. The popularity of overly dark skies will hopefully pass.', '2010-04-30 14:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981126, 873182, 15511, '<td valign="top">My observation is that all the dark parts of your image are too dark, which gives the image an overly contrasty look. Lightening the darker half with a curve will not eliminate significant detail from the highlights, and result in an image that appears natural.</td>', 'My observation is that all the dark parts of your image are too dark, which gives the image an overly contrasty look. Lightening the darker half with a curve will not eliminate significant detail from the highlights, and result in an image that appears natural.', '2010-04-30 14:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
