(5981216, 872309, 62357, '<td valign="top">Ordinarily this is a scene I would imagine to be more effective in colour.  But I think this really is lovely.</td>', 'Ordinarily this is a scene I would imagine to be more effective in colour.  But I think this really is lovely.', '2010-04-30 15:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
