(5983090, 874102, 75713, '<td valign="top">I like all the action in this shot .. at first glance it doesn''t look like much is going on as the tree is the focal point ... and then you see the waves and the drama in the sky - I like how the sun is shining on the water between the two points of land.  If this shot was cropped a little on the right, the tree''s anchorage to land wouldn''t show - I wonder if that would add to the overall composition?  The tonal range in this photo is very good and I enjoyed looking at your shot.</td>', 'I like all the action in this shot .. at first glance it doesn''t look like much is going on as the tree is the focal point ... and then you see the waves and the drama in the sky - I like how the sun is shining on the water between the two points of land.  If this shot was cropped a little on the right, the tree''s anchorage to land wouldn''t show - I wonder if that would add to the overall composition?  The tonal range in this photo is very good and I enjoyed looking at your shot.', '2010-05-01 16:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5983091, 873790, 91691, '<td valign="top">this would be an amazing picture but lacks detail in the shadows or some thing..</td>', 'this would be an amazing picture but lacks detail in the shadows or some thing..', '2010-05-01 16:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5983096, 874245, 75713, '<td valign="top">Quite a different take on landscape but it holds my interest and is a welcome break from the majority.  The cane is the visual that, to me, explains your title.  I look at the items by his feet and wonder if he was feeding the pigeons and had no luck, as the rest of the photo is clear from debris.  At first I thought the shot would benefit from being cropped on the top but then you would lose the natural frame.</td>', 'Quite a different take on landscape but it holds my interest and is a welcome break from the majority.  The cane is the visual that, to me, explains your title.  I look at the items by his feet and wonder if he was feeding the pigeons and had no luck, as the rest of the photo is clear from debris.  At first I thought the shot would benefit from being cropped on the top but then you would lose the natural frame.', '2010-05-01 17:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5983102, 873113, 75713, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of movement in this shot. They are brave souls to be on such a fragile looking structure :)  I like how the sky (quite a dramatic one)draws my eye to them - nice job in your b&amp;w conversion.</td>', 'There is a lot of movement in this shot. They are brave souls to be on such a fragile looking structure :)  I like how the sky (quite a dramatic one)draws my eye to them - nice job in your b&w conversion.', '2010-05-01 17:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5983104, 873755, 75713, '<td valign="top">Good tonal range in this shot - I like how you kept some detail in the foreground.</td>', 'Good tonal range in this shot - I like how you kept some detail in the foreground.', '2010-05-01 17:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5983108, 873605, 75713, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me want to visit there.  Your pp made this shot in my opinion, as I can''t imagine it as being so spectacular in color. Your focus is so crisp, from the water to the top of the steeples that I know it must look fantastic as a print.  Wonderfully composed and nothing I can see to suggest any improvements.</td>', 'This photo makes me want to visit there.  Your pp made this shot in my opinion, as I can''t imagine it as being so spectacular in color. Your focus is so crisp, from the water to the top of the steeples that I know it must look fantastic as a print.  Wonderfully composed and nothing I can see to suggest any improvements.', '2010-05-01 17:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
