(5984250, 873946, 81362, '<td valign="top">I find myself wishing for a main subject, or even a main geometric theme, as a hook to hold interest. Wonder if the color version would have made it easier to appreciate. Perhaps positioning to make the edge of the field serve as a diagonal line would add strength to the composition.</td>', 'I find myself wishing for a main subject, or even a main geometric theme, as a hook to hold interest. Wonder if the color version would have made it easier to appreciate. Perhaps positioning to make the edge of the field serve as a diagonal line would add strength to the composition.', '2010-05-02 11:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984257, 874246, 76335, '<td valign="top">Scanning the thumbs and this jumped out at me. I have trouble calling it a landscape, but I absolutely love the composition. This is the kind of stuff my lens is gravitating toward lately. Really good!</td>', 'Scanning the thumbs and this jumped out at me. I have trouble calling it a landscape, but I absolutely love the composition. This is the kind of stuff my lens is gravitating toward lately. Really good!', '2010-05-02 11:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
