(5984918, 874175, 106349, '<td valign="top">Could use more contrast</td>', 'Could use more contrast', '2010-05-02 19:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984919, 874228, 83313, '<td valign="top">My immediate reaction to this one, was "eh, not a lot of impact", but looking at it longer, I appreciate the quiet minimalism this has to it.</td>', 'My immediate reaction to this one, was "eh, not a lot of impact", but looking at it longer, I appreciate the quiet minimalism this has to it.', '2010-05-02 19:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984922, 874202, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the way the city is just popping out of the surrounding landscape.</td>', 'I like the way the city is just popping out of the surrounding landscape.', '2010-05-02 19:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984924, 872541, 106349, '<td valign="top">For just a bunch of trees, this came out great. Love the contrasting colors.</td>', 'For just a bunch of trees, this came out great. Love the contrasting colors.', '2010-05-02 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984925, 873013, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good use of tones. Everything stands out nicely in this shot, without any details becoming lost. Not too bright, but not dark either. Not a "WOW" shot, but certainly worthy of a vote on the positive side.</td>', 'Good use of tones. Everything stands out nicely in this shot, without any details becoming lost. Not too bright, but not dark either. Not a "WOW" shot, but certainly worthy of a vote on the positive side.', '2010-05-02 19:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984926, 873715, 106349, '<td valign="top">NICE SKY. I think the buildings should be a little lighter, though.</td>', 'NICE SKY. I think the buildings should be a little lighter, though.', '2010-05-02 19:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984930, 873531, 83313, '<td valign="top">Central Park? My only nitpick might be that the buildings are mostly hidden behind the trees. However, that is an aspect of the scene that just is what it is. I would be curious to see if you have any outtakes shot from that outcropping of rocks.</td>', 'Central Park? My only nitpick might be that the buildings are mostly hidden behind the trees. However, that is an aspect of the scene that just is what it is. I would be curious to see if you have any outtakes shot from that outcropping of rocks.', '2010-05-02 19:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984931, 872369, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts and good use of reflections. The sky is perfect.</td>', 'Nice contrasts and good use of reflections. The sky is perfect.', '2010-05-02 19:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984935, 873421, 83313, '<td valign="top">To be honest, this sort of scene is getting to be so common in challenges, that it no longer has strong impact for me and I have a hard time evaluating it objectively. I can''t give it a poor vote because it is well done, but it''s not having enough impact for me to give it a vote at the top of the scale. Sorry.</td>', 'To be honest, this sort of scene is getting to be so common in challenges, that it no longer has strong impact for me and I have a hard time evaluating it objectively. I can''t give it a poor vote because it is well done, but it''s not having enough impact for me to give it a vote at the top of the scale. Sorry.', '2010-05-02 20:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984936, 873951, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, though Some of the details get lost in it due to being similar tones. I had the same issue with a lot of my own potential entries. The combination of b/w plus basic rules made this one a challenge indeed.</td>', 'Nice scene, though Some of the details get lost in it due to being similar tones. I had the same issue with a lot of my own potential entries. The combination of b/w plus basic rules made this one a challenge indeed.', '2010-05-02 20:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984955, 873697, 83313, '<td valign="top">A pleasant scene, though it looks like you had some overly bright highlights and dark shadows to contend with. This was a tough challenge for basic editing rules.</td>', 'A pleasant scene, though it looks like you had some overly bright highlights and dark shadows to contend with. This was a tough challenge for basic editing rules.', '2010-05-02 20:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984957, 873942, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice one!  (But you do have the advantage of living in a scenic area.)  (No vote, just commenting)</td>', 'Nice one!  (But you do have the advantage of living in a scenic area.)  (No vote, just commenting)', '2010-05-02 20:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984958, 871856, 106349, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2010-05-02 20:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984959, 873231, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasty image, great cityscape.  (FWIW, I would have preferred either no frame or frame on all four sides.)  (No vote, just a comment)</td>', 'Nice contrasty image, great cityscape.  (FWIW, I would have preferred either no frame or frame on all four sides.)  (No vote, just a comment)', '2010-05-02 20:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984960, 874287, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene, but I would have loved to see the additional detail that using the 800 pixels allowed would have done for it. Aside from that, it is an very interesting subject and great use of b/w tones.</td>', 'Wonderful scene, but I would have loved to see the additional detail that using the 800 pixels allowed would have done for it. Aside from that, it is an very interesting subject and great use of b/w tones.', '2010-05-02 20:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984961, 874062, 106349, '<td valign="top">Amazing scene... but I think it could use a little more blacks.</td>', 'Amazing scene... but I think it could use a little more blacks.', '2010-05-02 20:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984962, 873688, 106349, '<td valign="top">This is great.</td>', 'This is great.', '2010-05-02 20:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984964, 872656, 83313, '<td valign="top">A very clean and neat looking image. Love the detail of the blimp in the sky.</td>', 'A very clean and neat looking image. Love the detail of the blimp in the sky.', '2010-05-02 20:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984965, 874084, 106349, '<td valign="top">I really don''t think the frame suits this... but I didn''t reduce my vote because of it.</td>', 'I really don''t think the frame suits this... but I didn''t reduce my vote because of it.', '2010-05-02 20:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984966, 872441, 106349, '<td valign="top">You did a good job bringing out the details in the leaves.</td>', 'You did a good job bringing out the details in the leaves.', '2010-05-02 20:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984967, 873814, 106349, '<td valign="top">VERY nice.</td>', 'VERY nice.', '2010-05-02 20:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984970, 873642, 106349, '<td valign="top">Foreground is a little too dark imo. But nice composition.</td>', 'Foreground is a little too dark imo. But nice composition.', '2010-05-02 20:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984971, 874079, 106349, '<td valign="top">LOVE it.</td>', 'LOVE it.', '2010-05-02 20:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984974, 873601, 83313, '<td valign="top">Awesome, but perhaps a little too dramatic for me. The high contrast is probably taking away some fine detail and my eye is trying to find that detail. I''m sure this nitpick will be in the minority. On the other hand, it is very Ansel-Adamsy. (Can I use that name as an adjective?)</td>', 'Awesome, but perhaps a little too dramatic for me. The high contrast is probably taking away some fine detail and my eye is trying to find that detail. I''m sure this nitpick will be in the minority. On the other hand, it is very Ansel-Adamsy. (Can I use that name as an adjective?)', '2010-05-02 20:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984994, 872945, 106349, '<td valign="top">Very blown out and not much detail.</td>', 'Very blown out and not much detail.', '2010-05-02 20:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5984998, 873820, 106349, '<td valign="top">This is great...</td>', 'This is great...', '2010-05-02 20:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985017, 872020, 116674, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.</td>', 'Cool shot.', '2010-05-02 20:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985027, 873994, 102278, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and dramatic. In my top ten of the challenge. 10</td>', 'Wonderful and dramatic. In my top ten of the challenge. 10', '2010-05-02 20:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985029, 874293, 102278, '<td valign="top">Fantastically eerie. In my top ten of the challenge. 10</td>', 'Fantastically eerie. In my top ten of the challenge. 10', '2010-05-02 20:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985030, 874156, 102278, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and other-worldly. Very apt title. In my top ten of the challenge. 10</td>', 'Beautiful and other-worldly. Very apt title. In my top ten of the challenge. 10', '2010-05-02 20:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985031, 872332, 102278, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  In my top ten of the challenge. 10</td>', 'Fantastic!  In my top ten of the challenge. 10', '2010-05-02 20:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985032, 874005, 102278, '<td valign="top">Stunning. So much going on both visually and in atmosphere.  In my top ten of the challenge. 10</td>', 'Stunning. So much going on both visually and in atmosphere.  In my top ten of the challenge. 10', '2010-05-02 20:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985033, 874230, 83313, '<td valign="top">A pleasing scene, perhaps a little grayish looking on some of mountains in the distance. I suspect you had a choice between strong contrast and bringing out some detail. If they had stronger contrast I would probably have said something about lack of detail. There''s just no pleasing some people, is there?</td>', 'A pleasing scene, perhaps a little grayish looking on some of mountains in the distance. I suspect you had a choice between strong contrast and bringing out some detail. If they had stronger contrast I would probably have said something about lack of detail. There''s just no pleasing some people, is there?', '2010-05-02 20:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985034, 874092, 102278, '<td valign="top">Simply amazing. A landscape of the mind.  In my top ten of the challenge. 10</td>', 'Simply amazing. A landscape of the mind.  In my top ten of the challenge. 10', '2010-05-02 20:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985035, 873176, 102278, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully bleak. In my top ten of the challenge. 10</td>', 'Wonderfully bleak. In my top ten of the challenge. 10', '2010-05-02 20:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985036, 873628, 102278, '<td valign="top">Amazing. Bleak apocalyptic landscape. Love it.  In my top ten of the challenge. 10</td>', 'Amazing. Bleak apocalyptic landscape. Love it.  In my top ten of the challenge. 10', '2010-05-02 20:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985038, 873817, 102278, '<td valign="top">Simply amazing. I love it.  In my top ten of the challenge. 10</td>', 'Simply amazing. I love it.  In my top ten of the challenge. 10', '2010-05-02 20:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985039, 872936, 102278, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully eerie and strange.  In my top ten of the challenge. 10</td>', 'Wonderfully eerie and strange.  In my top ten of the challenge. 10', '2010-05-02 20:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985044, 873054, 83313, '<td valign="top">To answer the question posed in the title: keep going until you find something interesting to photograph. (Ouch, sorry about that, but the title was begging for it and that snarky comment would not stay in.)</td>', 'To answer the question posed in the title: keep going until you find something interesting to photograph. (Ouch, sorry about that, but the title was begging for it and that snarky comment would not stay in.)', '2010-05-02 20:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985051, 874056, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pleasing place to sit and listen to the waves slap the shore. A nap here would be nice.</td>', 'Looks like a pleasing place to sit and listen to the waves slap the shore. A nap here would be nice.', '2010-05-02 20:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985054, 873646, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice strong contrast, perhaps a cranked up a little too much for me, though overall I think this entry should do well.</td>', 'Nice strong contrast, perhaps a cranked up a little too much for me, though overall I think this entry should do well.', '2010-05-02 20:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985056, 873736, 83313, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to explore this place.</td>', 'Makes me want to explore this place.', '2010-05-02 20:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985058, 874221, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet that is a awesome train ride!</td>', 'I''ll bet that is a awesome train ride!', '2010-05-02 20:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985060, 874098, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice an contrasty but still lots of detail. An ordinary scene, but photographed nicely.</td>', 'Nice an contrasty but still lots of detail. An ordinary scene, but photographed nicely.', '2010-05-02 20:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985063, 874298, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice scene, though it''s not jumping out at me as a "wow" shot. Not totally sure why. Maybe just a little too grayish overall for me.</td>', 'A nice scene, though it''s not jumping out at me as a "wow" shot. Not totally sure why. Maybe just a little too grayish overall for me.', '2010-05-02 20:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985067, 873605, 83313, '<td valign="top">I remember riding (or pushing) my bicycle up to visit this castle when I was stationed in Germany in the 80''s. Some wonderful scenery along the Rhein. I''m jealous.</td>', 'I remember riding (or pushing) my bicycle up to visit this castle when I was stationed in Germany in the 80''s. Some wonderful scenery along the Rhein. I''m jealous.', '2010-05-02 20:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985085, 872773, 106910, '<td valign="top">I really like how balanced this photo is... and the white-out works. Nice job.</td>', 'I really like how balanced this photo is... and the white-out works. Nice job.', '2010-05-02 21:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985086, 874044, 106910, '<td valign="top">I don''t the soft focus works for you here</td>', 'I don''t the soft focus works for you here', '2010-05-02 21:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985088, 872089, 106910, '<td valign="top">The trees look odd and are distracting from the beautiful clouds in the sky.</td>', 'The trees look odd and are distracting from the beautiful clouds in the sky.', '2010-05-02 21:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985090, 873590, 61971, '<td valign="top">Well I googled Verdugos to see what you were talking about (I thought it might have been a different language) After seeing what they were it really made me wish that a wider expanse of the mountains were visible. At this crop I do like the composition though.</td>', 'Well I googled Verdugos to see what you were talking about (I thought it might have been a different language) After seeing what they were it really made me wish that a wider expanse of the mountains were visible. At this crop I do like the composition though.', '2010-05-02 21:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985092, 872697, 61971, '<td valign="top">A softer feel really works for this picture I think. It would have been stronger in composition with a different crop taking out the very right tree and just leaving three of the dark trees on the left. This would have showcased the lighting of the sky and the tree in the middle nicely I think.</td>', 'A softer feel really works for this picture I think. It would have been stronger in composition with a different crop taking out the very right tree and just leaving three of the dark trees on the left. This would have showcased the lighting of the sky and the tree in the middle nicely I think.', '2010-05-02 21:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985093, 873240, 106910, '<td valign="top">Personal opinion - if the left fence connect more with the bottom of the photo, i feel like the photo would have been more dramatic. Also, i''m seeing some aliasing on the bright white are of the fence that''s distracting me.</td>', 'Personal opinion - if the left fence connect more with the bottom of the photo, i feel like the photo would have been more dramatic. Also, i''m seeing some aliasing on the bright white are of the fence that''s distracting me.', '2010-05-02 21:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985095, 874205, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the tone of this. I feel with the mailboxes are the subject here and not so much the landscape in the background though.</td>', 'I like the tone of this. I feel with the mailboxes are the subject here and not so much the landscape in the background though.', '2010-05-02 21:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985097, 874221, 106910, '<td valign="top">I feel a little bit of foreground would have allowed me to enjoy the photo just a little more. I like the train and the detail in the cliff a lot, though.</td>', 'I feel a little bit of foreground would have allowed me to enjoy the photo just a little more. I like the train and the detail in the cliff a lot, though.', '2010-05-02 21:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985098, 872888, 106910, '<td valign="top">Pixelated sky :(</td>', 'Pixelated sky :(', '2010-05-02 21:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985101, 873345, 61971, '<td valign="top">Your title makes me want to see more field and the texture that is there. I like the shades in the trees but I feel like they dominate the scene when the title indicates the field and barns as the main subject.</td>', 'Your title makes me want to see more field and the texture that is there. I like the shades in the trees but I feel like they dominate the scene when the title indicates the field and barns as the main subject.', '2010-05-02 21:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985102, 874285, 61971, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast in detail of the buildings to the right. I keep wanting to see the expanse of the river overflow thing though.</td>', 'I really like the contrast in detail of the buildings to the right. I keep wanting to see the expanse of the river overflow thing though.', '2010-05-02 21:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985103, 873054, 61971, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea, the waves, sand and motel look great. For me the clouds in the distance look overdone. (don''t know if this is caused by the black and white conversion or tweeking during processing) I feel this would have been stronger for me with a tighter crop from the left.</td>', 'I really like this idea, the waves, sand and motel look great. For me the clouds in the distance look overdone. (don''t know if this is caused by the black and white conversion or tweeking during processing) I feel this would have been stronger for me with a tighter crop from the left.', '2010-05-02 21:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985105, 871749, 61971, '<td valign="top">Nice back yard. I really like the blacks in the grass closer to the camera. imo this would have been better without the tree and from a closer to the ground perspective. You would have had more of that good black grass texture that flowed to the lighter grays and finally to the trees in the distance with a little less of the cloud cover.</td>', 'Nice back yard. I really like the blacks in the grass closer to the camera. imo this would have been better without the tree and from a closer to the ground perspective. You would have had more of that good black grass texture that flowed to the lighter grays and finally to the trees in the distance with a little less of the cloud cover.', '2010-05-02 21:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985107, 874083, 106910, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I think more contrast would have brought out the title/subject a little more and may have even made it a bigger impact to the viewer. Otherwise - the grays don''t vary and the photo isn''t very dramatic.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I think more contrast would have brought out the title/subject a little more and may have even made it a bigger impact to the viewer. Otherwise - the grays don''t vary and the photo isn''t very dramatic.', '2010-05-02 21:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985112, 872866, 61971, '<td valign="top">Nice deep depth of field here. I like the walkway since it adds a different element to a picture of trees, but I think I would have liked a different perspective better. Maybe if you were on the walkway.</td>', 'Nice deep depth of field here. I like the walkway since it adds a different element to a picture of trees, but I think I would have liked a different perspective better. Maybe if you were on the walkway.', '2010-05-02 21:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985114, 874228, 106910, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and most of its execution - all except the funny shaped moon up at the top. It''s a little noisy - but not enough to ruin the mood of the photo. Overall a decent photo - 6.</td>', 'I like the concept and most of its execution - all except the funny shaped moon up at the top. It''s a little noisy - but not enough to ruin the mood of the photo. Overall a decent photo - 6.', '2010-05-02 21:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985116, 873502, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and it really looks like a cool place. I feel like it is a little dark overall though.</td>', 'I like the idea and it really looks like a cool place. I feel like it is a little dark overall though.', '2010-05-02 21:21:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5985121, 872065, 106910, '<td valign="top">The animal''s head''s getting lost in its torso. I love the detail in the barn. I feel like a little bit more contrast (and some selective dodging... which sucks we couldn''t do) would have done this photo well. 6</td>', 'The animal''s head''s getting lost in its torso. I love the detail in the barn. I feel like a little bit more contrast (and some selective dodging... which sucks we couldn''t do) would have done this photo well. 6', '2010-05-02 21:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985126, 874297, 61971, '<td valign="top">Great shadows, and I love how the sidewalk rolls. This doesn''t feel like a landscape to me though.</td>', 'Great shadows, and I love how the sidewalk rolls. This doesn''t feel like a landscape to me though.', '2010-05-02 21:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985128, 873294, 106910, '<td valign="top">The emptiness on the bottom of the photo leaves me hanging when viewing it. But, had the sky been open more, I would have liked the photo more... So maybe I just prefer the negative space up top. 6</td>', 'The emptiness on the bottom of the photo leaves me hanging when viewing it. But, had the sky been open more, I would have liked the photo more... So maybe I just prefer the negative space up top. 6', '2010-05-02 21:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985129, 874049, 106910, '<td valign="top">The photo is tilted (needs about a 1 degree rotation to CCW) and throws the perspective off. BUT - I love the framing.</td>', 'The photo is tilted (needs about a 1 degree rotation to CCW) and throws the perspective off. BUT - I love the framing.', '2010-05-02 21:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985130, 874289, 106910, '<td valign="top">I can''t really see the pontoon dock</td>', 'I can''t really see the pontoon dock', '2010-05-02 21:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985133, 872836, 106910, '<td valign="top">Very nice cloud - but oddly distracting shadows on the sidewalk.</td>', 'Very nice cloud - but oddly distracting shadows on the sidewalk.', '2010-05-02 21:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985139, 873647, 106910, '<td valign="top">Ugh - I WISH this photo was larger. And, in this way, I think the border hurts you a little bit, because all the beautiful details (water drops and plants) are scrunched due to the limit of resolution. I don''t hate the border - just don''t feel it works in this photo - particularly this photo online. I would love to see a full version of this.</td>', 'Ugh - I WISH this photo was larger. And, in this way, I think the border hurts you a little bit, because all the beautiful details (water drops and plants) are scrunched due to the limit of resolution. I don''t hate the border - just don''t feel it works in this photo - particularly this photo online. I would love to see a full version of this.', '2010-05-02 21:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985144, 873358, 106910, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very detailed - i just don''t know about that sky. 7</td>', 'Very nice, very detailed - i just don''t know about that sky. 7', '2010-05-02 21:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985145, 874127, 106910, '<td valign="top">Timelapse + title = nice</td>', 'Timelapse + title = nice', '2010-05-02 21:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985147, 873676, 106910, '<td valign="top">I really like this.</td>', 'I really like this.', '2010-05-02 21:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985150, 874293, 106910, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful! I love the mist and the reflections... I need to find a pond like this.</td>', 'Very beautiful! I love the mist and the reflections... I need to find a pond like this.', '2010-05-02 21:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985151, 872066, 106910, '<td valign="top">The detail in the front subject is wonderful - and seriously, I think the border works here.</td>', 'The detail in the front subject is wonderful - and seriously, I think the border works here.', '2010-05-02 21:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985153, 872348, 106910, '<td valign="top">Very picturesque</td>', 'Very picturesque', '2010-05-02 21:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985155, 873120, 61971, '<td valign="top">Those are some cool looking clouds, and I like the texture in the rocks. I think overall the blacks are a little too dark though, as it pulls most of my attention to the sky.</td>', 'Those are some cool looking clouds, and I like the texture in the rocks. I think overall the blacks are a little too dark though, as it pulls most of my attention to the sky.', '2010-05-02 21:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985158, 873847, 61971, '<td valign="top">This slide looks so out of place in this setting. These look like an old foundation or something. Cool subject, but it doesn''t feel like a landscape to me.</td>', 'This slide looks so out of place in this setting. These look like an old foundation or something. Cool subject, but it doesn''t feel like a landscape to me.', '2010-05-02 21:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985160, 874110, 83313, '<td valign="top">The composition is coming off to me a little awkward. I do realize that the waterfall is the main subject, but the other elements that my eye want to explore (like the mountain) seem cramped or cut off</td>', 'The composition is coming off to me a little awkward. I do realize that the waterfall is the main subject, but the other elements that my eye want to explore (like the mountain) seem cramped or cut off', '2010-05-02 21:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985163, 874048, 106910, '<td valign="top">Yep - definitely wishing I could see the color of the rainbow... but, i''ve never seen a rainbow like this. The clouds are good - but there''s something not quite right about the trees and I can''t put my finger on it.</td>', 'Yep - definitely wishing I could see the color of the rainbow... but, i''ve never seen a rainbow like this. The clouds are good - but there''s something not quite right about the trees and I can''t put my finger on it.', '2010-05-02 21:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
