(5985647, 873877, 100831, '<td valign="top">ooooo .... the blacks are intense! Not that it''s a bad thing... And I like the almost abstractness of the pattern and the expansiveness due to that powerful leading line - and the way it''s all kind of abruptly cut off at the horizon. Very interesting photo, a lot to think about. Great job.<br/> <br/>Coming back to vote and it''s a 7 from me.</td>', 'ooooo .... the blacks are intense! Not that it''s a bad thing... And I like the almost abstractness of the pattern and the expansiveness due to that powerful leading line - and the way it''s all kind of abruptly cut off at the horizon. Very interesting photo, a lot to think about. Great job. Coming back to vote and it''s a 7 from me.', '2010-05-02 23:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5985648, 873710, 100831, '<td valign="top">Lovely contrasts in tone and texture. Nice compositinal elements here.</td>', 'Lovely contrasts in tone and texture. Nice compositinal elements here.', '2010-05-02 23:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
