(5988302, 873658, 69684, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo (6), but you have some nice outtakes, <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=873637" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_873637.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_873637.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_873637.jpg"/></a> is my favorite.</td>', 'Very nice photo (6), but you have some nice outtakes,  is my favorite.', '2010-05-03 19:19:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5988308, 873531, 76335, '<td valign="top">So sorry this didn''t come up for me. DPC loves eyepopping contrast, and so this very lovely springtime scene was probably lost on the majority of the voters. Personally, I like it; I have a thing for mid-key. Instead of the eye being drawn straight trhough the scene and into the sky, the viewer is forced to take in the highlights in the leaves and the dappled shadows on the ground. More subtle but equally beautiful stuff. Nice job!</td>', 'So sorry this didn''t come up for me. DPC loves eyepopping contrast, and so this very lovely springtime scene was probably lost on the majority of the voters. Personally, I like it; I have a thing for mid-key. Instead of the eye being drawn straight trhough the scene and into the sky, the viewer is forced to take in the highlights in the leaves and the dappled shadows on the ground. More subtle but equally beautiful stuff. Nice job!', '2010-05-03 19:30:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5988373, 872548, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Greg. That is an exquisite view of Sydney.</td>', 'Congratulations Greg. That is an exquisite view of Sydney.', '2010-05-03 20:06:54.000000', NULL, 0),
