(5988416, 873628, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> Well, I added to my vocabulary today! Extra pointage for making me go to the trouble of looking it up. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I looked it up too! Glad to see that this got the posthumous blue. Well deserved.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Well, I added to my vocabulary today! Extra pointage for making me go to the trouble of looking it up.   I looked it up too! Glad to see that this got the posthumous blue. Well deserved.', '2010-05-03 20:58:16.000000', NULL, 0),
