(5991142, 872278, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by annig:</b></div><hr/><i> I like it...<br/> <br/>how''s it look in color? <br/>Nicely done, Bear. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The full-color version just looks like a sepia-toned version of the B/W. In fact, I did MAKE a toned version of this, but in the end decided people would think it was a color image :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by annig: I like it... how''s it look in color? Nicely done, Bear.   The full-color version just looks like a sepia-toned version of the B/W. In fact, I did MAKE a toned version of this, but in the end decided people would think it was a color image :-)', '2010-05-05 01:37:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5991210, 872332, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. I''d have expected a higher score, actually. Amazing that a 6.2 only yields 38th place, such a high-scoring challenge... It''s my sense of it that the more intricate, less dramatic images didn''t fare as well as they perhaps ought to, but I know which category I''d rather have a 20x24 of on my wall :-)</td>', 'This is lovely. I''d have expected a higher score, actually. Amazing that a 6.2 only yields 38th place, such a high-scoring challenge... It''s my sense of it that the more intricate, less dramatic images didn''t fare as well as they perhaps ought to, but I know which category I''d rather have a 20x24 of on my wall :-)', '2010-05-05 01:46:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5991225, 874297, 50641, '<td valign="top">nice - i love picket shadows</td>', 'nice - i love picket shadows', '2010-05-05 01:49:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5991310, 873773, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this vista a number of times in my travels up and down the coast. It''s one of my favorites of all time. I think you did it very well. The processing could perhaps be a tad richer and more luminous, but you''re not far off the mark at all, for a non-landscape-photographer :-)<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'I''ve seen this vista a number of times in my travels up and down the coast. It''s one of my favorites of all time. I think you did it very well. The processing could perhaps be a tad richer and more luminous, but you''re not far off the mark at all, for a non-landscape-photographer :-) Well done!', '2010-05-05 02:02:45.000000', NULL, 0),
