(5991651, 873648, 56744, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing pic that reminds me these great classical landscape paintings. Composition it''s superb! Sara, please, use advanced edit and take this image to a top level.</td>', 'This is an amazing pic that reminds me these great classical landscape paintings. Composition it''s superb! Sara, please, use advanced edit and take this image to a top level.', '2010-05-05 06:09:51.000000', NULL, 0),
