(5994269, 873569, 16219, '<td valign="top">This is better than St Michel, rather the subject is better in St Michel, but this is the superior photo. Note the clarity of the reflection.</td>', 'This is better than St Michel, rather the subject is better in St Michel, but this is the superior photo. Note the clarity of the reflection.', '2010-05-06 11:39:02.000000', NULL, 0),
