(6249583, 874295, 93283, '<td valign="top">For what its worth, I voted this shot a 7. Its been awhile and I don''t remember my impressions at the time, but I can tell you that I think this is an awesome shot. I am a huge fan of landscapes and wide angles (I own the same sigma lense) and to me this really is an underrated photo...</td>', 'For what its worth, I voted this shot a 7. Its been awhile and I don''t remember my impressions at the time, but I can tell you that I think this is an awesome shot. I am a huge fan of landscapes and wide angles (I own the same sigma lense) and to me this really is an underrated photo...', '2010-12-08 23:02:51.000000', NULL, 0),
